<section class="sk-hero"><div class="sk-w sk-hero-g"><div class="sk-hero-t"><p class="sk-ey">Learning, for grown-ups</p><h1 aria-label="skillio"><span style="--i:0">s</span><span style="--i:1">k</span><span style="--i:2">i</span><span style="--i:3">l</span><span style="--i:4">l</span><span style="--i:5">i</span><span style="--i:6">o</span></h1><p class="sk-hero-p">Pick up a new skill, one small session at a time. Guides and planners for learning pottery, code, music, languages and anything else you are curious about.</p><div class="sk-hero-a"><a class="sk-btn" href="learn-any-skill-guide.html">Start learning</a><a class="sk-btn sk-btn2" href="#planner">Plan 20 hours</a></div></div>
<div class="sk-hero-v" id="hero-v"><span class="sk-chip sk-y" style="left:8%;top:18%;--d:5s">Pottery</span><span class="sk-chip sk-b" style="left:78%;top:10%;--d:6s">Coding</span><span class="sk-chip sk-m" style="left:88%;top:58%;--d:7s">Guitar</span><span class="sk-chip sk-c" style="left:4%;top:72%;--d:8s">Drawing</span><span class="sk-chip sk-m" style="left:46%;top:4%;--d:9s">Languages</span><span class="sk-chip sk-y" style="left:60%;top:86%;--d:10s">Cooking</span><span class="sk-chip sk-b" style="left:26%;top:90%;--d:11s">Sewing</span><figure class="sk-hc sk-hc0" data-depth=".04" style="--r:-6deg"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1753164727411-81f9e1e776f8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=640&q=75" alt="a teacher and students at a pottery class" width="520" height="640" fetchpriority="high"></figure><figure class="sk-hc sk-hc1" data-depth=".08" style="--r:4deg"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534665482403-a909d0d97c67?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=640&q=75" alt="a man learning to code on a laptop" width="520" height="640" fetchpriority="high"></figure><figure class="sk-hc sk-hc2" data-depth=".12" style="--r:-2deg"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1593444285563-4479fb28226e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=640&q=75" alt="a typewriter with a page that reads learning" width="520" height="640" fetchpriority="high"></figure></div></div></section>

<section class="sk-s sk-tr"><div class="sk-w"><div class="sk-tr-h"><p class="sk-ey">The learning path</p><h2 class="rv">From curious to fluent</h2><p class="sk-p">Every skill follows roughly the same path. The trick is to keep moving from one stop to the next.</p></div><svg class="sk-tree" viewBox="0 0 960 300" aria-hidden="true"><path class="sk-tb" d="M80 210C180 210 180 90 280 90S380 210 480 210 580 90 680 90 780 210 880 210"/><path id="tr-p" class="sk-tp" pathLength="1" d="M80 210C180 210 180 90 280 90S380 210 480 210 580 90 680 90 780 210 880 210"/><g class="sk-nd" data-i="0"><circle cx="80" cy="210" r="30"/><text x="80" y="218">1</text><text class="lb" x="80" y="274">Curious</text></g><g class="sk-nd" data-i="1"><circle cx="280" cy="90" r="30"/><text x="280" y="98">2</text><text class="lb" x="280" y="42">Basics</text></g><g class="sk-nd" data-i="2"><circle cx="480" cy="210" r="30"/><text x="480" y="218">3</text><text class="lb" x="480" y="274">Practice</text></g><g class="sk-nd" data-i="3"><circle cx="680" cy="90" r="30"/><text x="680" y="98">4</text><text class="lb" x="680" y="42">Projects</text></g><g class="sk-nd" data-i="4"><circle cx="880" cy="210" r="30"/><text x="880" y="218">5</text><text class="lb" x="880" y="274">Fluent</text></g></svg><div class="sk-tr-l stg"><p class="rv"><b>Curious</b>Pick one skill and a reason you care.</p><p class="rv"><b>Basics</b>Learn the few fundamentals that matter most.</p><p class="rv"><b>Practice</b>Short, focused, regular sessions.</p><p class="rv"><b>Projects</b>Make real things and get feedback.</p><p class="rv"><b>Fluent</b>It starts to feel natural, and fun.</p></div></div></section>

<section class="sk-s sk-pl" id="planner"><div class="sk-w sk-pl-g"><div><p class="sk-ey">Tool 01</p><h2 class="rv">The 20-hour planner</h2><p class="sk-p">A popular rule of thumb says about 20 hours of focused practice gets you past the awkward beginner stage of most skills. See when you would get there.</p>
<label class="sk-lb" for="pl-s">I want to learn<input id="pl-s" type="text" value="pottery" maxlength="30"></label><label class="sk-lb" for="pl-m">Minutes per session <output id="pl-mo">30</output></label><input type="range" id="pl-m" min="10" max="120" step="5" value="30">
<fieldset class="sk-days"><legend>Sessions per week</legend><div id="pl-d"><button type="button" data-v="1">1</button><button type="button" data-v="2">2</button><button type="button" data-v="3">3</button><button type="button" data-v="4" class="on">4</button><button type="button" data-v="5">5</button><button type="button" data-v="6">6</button><button type="button" data-v="7">7</button></div></fieldset><figure class="sk-pl-i rv rv-c"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501504905252-473c47e087f8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=620&h=340&q=75" alt="a laptop, notebook and coffee on a desk" width="620" height="340" loading="lazy"></figure></div>
<div class="sk-pl-o"><div class="sk-ring"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="50" class="rt"/><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="50" class="rf" id="pl-r" pathLength="100"/></svg><div><b id="pl-w">8</b><span>weeks</span></div></div><p class="sk-pl-t" id="pl-t" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="sk-heat" id="pl-h" aria-hidden="true"></div><p class="sk-small">Each square is a day. Coloured squares are practice days.</p></div></div></section>

<section class="sk-s sk-ss" id="session"><div class="sk-w"><div class="sk-ss-h"><p class="sk-ey">Tool 02</p><h2 class="rv">Build a practice session</h2><p class="sk-p">Good sessions have a shape: a short warm-up, focused work on one hard thing, a quick review and a proper break. Pick a length and press start.</p></div>
<div class="sk-ss-g"><div class="sk-ss-c"><div class="sk-len" id="ss-l" role="group" aria-label="Session length"><button type="button" data-v="25">25 min</button><button type="button" data-v="45" class="on">45 min</button><button type="button" data-v="60">60 min</button><button type="button" data-v="90">90 min</button></div>
<div class="sk-bar" id="ss-b"></div><ol class="sk-blk" id="ss-k"></ol><div class="sk-run"><button type="button" class="sk-btn" id="ss-go">Start session</button><p id="ss-n" aria-live="polite">Ready when you are.</p></div></div><figure class="sk-ss-i rv rv-c"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1603354350317-6f7aaa5911c5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=560&h=700&q=75" alt="hands writing notes beside colourful sticky notes" width="560" height="700" loading="lazy"></figure></div></div></section>

<section class="sk-s sk-be"><div class="sk-w"><div class="sk-be-h"><p class="sk-ey">Ways to learn</p><h2 class="rv">There is no single right way</h2></div><div class="sk-bg"><figure class="sk-bt sk-bt0 rv"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512238972088-8acb84db0771?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&h=520&q=75" alt="a small group studying together at a table" width="800" height="520" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Learn with others</figcaption></figure><figure class="sk-bt sk-bt1 rv"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1752649937266-1900d9e176c3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=520&q=75" alt="an art class painting at easels" width="520" height="520" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Try a class</figcaption></figure><figure class="sk-bt sk-bt2 rv"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1771523350538-29baf74f710c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=520&q=75" alt="hands shaping clay on a pottery wheel" width="520" height="520" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Get your hands busy</figcaption></figure><figure class="sk-bt sk-bt3 rv"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1562939651-9359f291c988?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=520&q=75" alt="sticky notes on a wall during planning" width="520" height="520" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Plan the steps</figcaption></figure><div class="sk-bn rv"><b data-count="20">20</b><span>hours to get going</span><b data-count="10">10</b><span>minutes a day still counts</span></div></div></div></section>

